<title>USA: Wis Energy merger vote set for Jan 21.</title>
<headline>Wis Energy merger vote set for Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Public Service Commission of Wisconsin has set January 21 as the date when it would meet to decide on a merger application of Wisconsin Energy Corp and Northern States Power Co, a commission spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The three-member commission voted Thursday not to delay consideration of the merger, announced by the two companies on May 1, 1995.</p>
<p>The merger would create Primergy Corp.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
